    "A barrel-shaped cell that hunts Paramecium" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Sel berbentuk tong yang memburu Paramecium"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A bell-shaped cell on a spring-like stalk" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Sel berbentuk lonceng di atas tangkai seperti pegas"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A blend can combine gradual release from organic material with readily available nutrients. How it behaves depends on what is in it and how much is applied." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Campuran bisa menggabungkan pelepasan bertahap dari bahan organik dengan unsur hara yang cepat tersedia. Perilakunya bergantung pada isinya dan seberapa banyak yang diberikan."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A branching golden alga living in little cups" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Alga keemasan bercabang yang hidup di dalam cangkir kecil"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A fast, slipper-shaped single cell covered in tiny hairs" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Sel tunggal berbentuk sandal yang bergerak cepat dan berselimut rambut halus"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A field report of the soil measurements, the microscope test if there is one, the fertilizer and the advice above, to share or print." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Laporan lapangan berisi pengukuran tanah, uji mikroskop jika ada, pupuk, dan saran di atas, untuk dibagikan atau dicetak."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A flat, leaf-shaped relative of Euglena" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Kerabat Euglena yang pipih berbentuk daun"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A flat, star-shaped green alga" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Alga hijau pipih berbentuk bintang"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A pH a little above the target may make phosphorus and some micronutrients less available. Flooding often moves it back toward neutral, so it is worth watching." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "pH sedikit di atas target bisa membuat fosfor dan beberapa unsur hara mikro kurang tersedia. Penggenangan sering mengembalikannya ke arah netral, jadi sebaiknya dipantau."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A provisional first draft for flooded rice paddies. No agronomist has reviewed it yet." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Draf awal sementara untuk padi sawah. Belum ada ahli agronomi yang meninjaunya."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A provisional target range for flooded rice soils is around pH 6.0–7.0. The best range depends on soil type, flooding duration, rice variety, and how the pH was measured. Flooding can move acidic or alkaline soils toward near-neutral pH, and the pH of dry, air-dried soil may differ from the pH around rice roots after flooding. A pH reading should be read with how and when it was measured, and a low or high value does not by itself call for any particular amendment." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Rentang target sementara untuk tanah padi sawah adalah sekitar pH 6,0–7,0. Rentang terbaik bergantung pada jenis tanah, lama penggenangan, varietas padi, dan cara pH diukur. Penggenangan bisa menggeser tanah asam atau basa mendekati pH netral, dan pH tanah kering atau kering angin bisa berbeda dengan pH di sekitar akar padi setelah penggenangan. Hasil pH sebaiknya dibaca bersama cara dan waktu pengukurannya, dan nilai rendah atau tinggi saja tidak serta-merta memerlukan bahan pembenah tertentu."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A sample like this can mean more nutrients than the crop needs." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Sampel seperti ini bisa berarti unsur hara lebih banyak dari kebutuhan tanaman."
          }
        }
      }
    },
