    "Inorganic fertilizers can supply specific nutrients in predictable, readily available forms. Too much or poorly timed application can increase nutrient loss, soil acidification, salinity, or nutrient imbalance." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Pupuk anorganik bisa menyediakan unsur hara tertentu dalam bentuk yang terukur dan cepat tersedia. Pemberian yang berlebihan atau tidak tepat waktu bisa meningkatkan kehilangan hara, pengasaman tanah, salinitas, atau ketidakseimbangan hara."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Is part of soil organic matter and supports soil structure, microbial activity, nutrient retention, and water-holding capacity." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
