    "Manufactured or mineral fertilizer supplying nutrients in more readily available forms. It may provide predictable nutrient amounts, but incorrect use can contribute to nutrient loss, acidification, salinity, or imbalance." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Pupuk buatan pabrik atau mineral yang menyediakan unsur hara dalam bentuk yang lebih cepat tersedia. Jumlah haranya bisa lebih terukur, tetapi penggunaan yang salah bisa menyebabkan kehilangan hara, pengasaman, salinitas, atau ketidakseimbangan."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Many Euglena-type organisms were seen, which often means still, nutrient-rich water." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
