        }
      }
    },
    "More nitrogen than the standard. It can support strong growth, but how it behaves depends on whether it is held in organic matter or is free in the soil, so it is worth watching." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Nitrogen di atas standar. Ini bisa mendukung pertumbuhan yang kuat, tetapi perilakunya bergantung pada apakah nitrogen terikat dalam bahan organik atau bebas di tanah, jadi sebaiknya dipantau."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "More organic matter than the standard. This is often favorable, as long as the soil still gets enough air." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bahan organik di atas standar. Ini sering menguntungkan, selama tanah masih mendapat cukup udara."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "More samples are needed before a trend can be shown.  " : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Perlu lebih banyak sampel sebelum tren bisa ditampilkan.  "
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "More than the standard, which is often favorable for strong stems and water regulation." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Di atas standar, yang sering menguntungkan untuk batang yang kuat dan pengaturan air."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "More than the standard. Flooding often frees phosphorus already in the soil, so adding more is rarely needed." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Di atas standar. Penggenangan sering melepaskan fosfor yang sudah ada di tanah, jadi jarang perlu ditambah."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Move toward organic fertilizer, such as compost, by replacing part of your mineral fertilizer over the next seasons. Ask your extension officer how much to change." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Beralihlah ke pupuk organik, seperti kompos, dengan mengganti sebagian pupuk mineral Anda pada musim-musim berikutnya. Tanyakan kepada penyuluh pertanian seberapa banyak yang perlu diganti."
          }
        }
      }
    },
