    "Paddy research generally finds organic fertilizer, even replacing part of the mineral kind, keeps soil carbon and yields steadier." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Penelitian di sawah umumnya menemukan bahwa pupuk organik, bahkan jika hanya menggantikan sebagian pupuk mineral, membuat karbon tanah dan hasil panen lebih stabil."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pause phosphorus-rich inputs such as manure, keep the ground covered, and ask an extension officer." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Hentikan sementara bahan yang kaya fosfor seperti pupuk kandang, jaga tanah tetap tertutup, dan tanyakan kepada penyuluh pertanian."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pause potassium-rich inputs such as ash for a while, and ask an extension officer before a major change." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Hentikan sementara bahan yang kaya kalium seperti abu, dan tanyakan kepada penyuluh pertanian sebelum perubahan besar."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pause potassium-rich inputs, such as wood ash, for a while." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Hentikan sementara bahan yang kaya kalium, seperti abu kayu."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Phosphorous (P)" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
