    "Potassium is low, and plants use it for strong stems and to save water." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Kalium rendah, dan tanaman memakainya untuk batang yang kuat dan menghemat air."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Probe and laboratory readings can differ, and a reading depends on where, how deep and when the soil was sampled. Only the latest measurements are kept." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Hasil alat ukur lapangan dan laboratorium bisa berbeda, dan hasilnya bergantung pada di mana, seberapa dalam, dan kapan tanah diambil sampelnya. Hanya pengukuran terbaru yang disimpan."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Product" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Produk"
          }
        }
