        }
      }
    },
    "Still, nutrient-rich water can be short of air, and a short drain lets air in." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Air diam yang kaya unsur hara bisa kekurangan udara, dan pengeringan singkat membuat udara masuk."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Stop adding manure and other phosphorus-rich inputs for now, and keep the ground covered." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Hentikan dulu pemberian pupuk kandang dan bahan lain yang kaya fosfor, dan jaga agar tanah tetap tertutup."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Suits paddies" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cocok untuk sawah"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Supports chlorophyll, leaves, stems, proteins, and plant growth." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Mendukung klorofil, daun, batang, protein, dan pertumbuhan tanaman."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Supports energy transfer, roots, cell membranes, flowering, seed formation, and maturity." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Mendukung perpindahan energi, akar, membran sel, pembungaan, pembentukan biji, dan pematangan."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Switch role" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ganti peran"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Talk to your local extension officer before making big changes." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bicarakan dengan penyuluh pertanian setempat sebelum melakukan perubahan besar."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tap Anywhere" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ketuk di mana saja"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tap the map to drop a dot on each corner, going round the edge in order." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ketuk peta untuk menaruh titik di setiap sudut, berurutan mengelilingi tepinya."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tap to see each kind" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ketuk untuk melihat tiap jenis"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Test again in 2 to 4 weeks. If the result stays low, send a sample to a lab." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Uji lagi dalam 2 sampai 4 minggu. Jika hasilnya tetap rendah, kirim sampel ke lab."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Test again next season, or sooner if the crop changes." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Uji lagi musim depan, atau lebih cepat jika tanamannya berubah."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Testate amoebae" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Amoeba bercangkang"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tests" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Uji"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Thanks, saved." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Terima kasih, sudah disimpan."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The advice could not be written. Try again." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Saran tidak bisa ditulis. Coba lagi."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The app's fixed rules chose every step from the microscope test and the soil measurements." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Aturan tetap aplikasi memilih setiap langkah dari uji mikroskop dan pengukuran tanah."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The detector did not run on this sweep." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Detektor tidak berjalan pada pemindaian ini."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The edges cross each other. Undo, then place the dots in order round the edge." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Sisi-sisinya saling bersilangan. Urungkan, lalu taruh titik berurutan mengelilingi tepinya."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The effect depends on the product, amount, timing, soil test, and field conditions." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Efeknya bergantung pada produk, jumlah, waktu pemberian, uji tanah, dan kondisi lahan."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The farm and its plots will be removed from this phone and the records." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Lahan dan petak-petaknya akan dihapus dari ponsel ini dan dari catatan."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The farm manager reads published tests in the farm's records." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Pengelola lahan membaca uji yang diterbitkan di catatan lahan."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The farms could not be saved: %@" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Lahan tidak bisa disimpan: %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The field helper does not know the fertilizer category. Nothing is inferred from this." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Pendamping lapangan tidak tahu kategori pupuknya. Tidak ada kesimpulan yang diambil dari sini."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The field was drained, and dry soil hides many organisms." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Sawah sedang dikeringkan, dan tanah kering menyembunyikan banyak organisme."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The land" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Lahan"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The land you marked, %@, becomes this farm's first plot." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Lahan yang Anda tandai, %@, menjadi petak pertama lahan ini."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The limits used are guesses, not checked against lab tests." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Batas yang dipakai masih perkiraan, belum dicek dengan uji lab."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The pH is below the provisional range for flooded rice, which can make some nutrients harder to use." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "pH di bawah rentang sementara untuk padi sawah, yang bisa membuat beberapa unsur hara lebih sulit dimanfaatkan."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The pH is well above the provisional range for flooded rice, which can make some nutrients less available." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "pH jauh di atas rentang sementara untuk padi sawah, yang bisa membuat beberapa unsur hara kurang tersedia."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The plot's outline will be removed from this phone and the records." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Batas petak akan dihapus dari ponsel ini dan dari catatan."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The saved farms could not be read. The old file was kept aside and the list started empty." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Lahan yang tersimpan tidak bisa dibaca. Berkas lama disimpan terpisah dan daftar dimulai dari kosong."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The signs in this sample point different ways." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tanda-tanda di sampel ini menunjukkan arah yang berbeda-beda."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The soil has a useful level of organic matter for its conditions." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tanah memiliki kadar bahan organik yang bermanfaat untuk kondisinya."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The soil measurements changed and Apple Intelligence couldn't write new wording, so standard advice for the new measurements is shown." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Pengukuran tanah berubah dan Apple Intelligence tidak bisa menulis kata-kata baru, jadi saran standar untuk pengukuran baru yang ditampilkan."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The soil measurements point to a few changes too." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Pengukuran tanah juga menunjukkan beberapa perubahan yang perlu dilakukan."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The sweep stopped before it finished." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Pemindaian berhenti sebelum selesai."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The type is what the field helper chose from a list. “No fertilizer recorded” does not mean none was used, and “Not sure” is never guessed at. No step gives a product, an amount or a rate." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Jenisnya adalah pilihan pendamping lapangan dari daftar. “Tidak ada pupuk yang dicatat” tidak berarti tidak ada pupuk yang dipakai, dan “Tidak yakin” tidak pernah ditebak. Tidak ada langkah yang menyebutkan produk, jumlah, atau takaran."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The wording is the app's standard advice." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Kata-katanya adalah saran standar aplikasi."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The written advice didn't pass the app's checks, so standard advice is shown." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Saran yang ditulis tidak lolos pemeriksaan aplikasi, jadi saran standar yang ditampilkan."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "There is more nitrogen than plants need, which can weaken stems and attract pests." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Nitrogen lebih banyak dari kebutuhan tanaman, yang bisa melemahkan batang dan mengundang hama."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "There is more phosphorus than plants need, and the extra can wash into waterways." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Fosfor lebih banyak dari kebutuhan tanaman, dan kelebihannya bisa terbawa ke saluran air."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "There is more potassium than plants need, and it can crowd out other nutrients." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Kalium lebih banyak dari kebutuhan tanaman, dan bisa menghambat unsur hara lain."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This build is not set up to publish." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Versi aplikasi ini belum diatur untuk menerbitkan."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This farm is no longer here" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Lahan ini sudah tidak ada"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This farm's pH reading: %@." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Hasil pH lahan ini: %@."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This iPhone cannot run Apple Intelligence." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "iPhone ini tidak bisa menjalankan Apple Intelligence."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This is an early prototype. The estimate and advice are not scientifically tested. Use your own judgement before acting on them." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ini masih purwarupa awal. Perkiraan dan saran ini belum diuji secara ilmiah. Gunakan pertimbangan Anda sendiri sebelum menjalankannya."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This is from the soil measurements only. No microscope test has been taken yet." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ini hanya dari pengukuran tanah. Belum ada uji mikroskop."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This is the first comparable sample for this farm. The next one, taken in the same water state, will show what changed." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ini sampel pertama yang bisa dibandingkan untuk lahan ini. Sampel berikutnya, yang diambil dalam kondisi air yang sama, akan menunjukkan apa yang berubah."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This outline overlaps %@'s land. Move the dots so it stays on this farmer's own land, or confirm anyway if the overlap is only GPS error." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Batas ini tumpang tindih dengan lahan %@. Geser titik-titiknya agar tetap di lahan petani ini sendiri, atau tetap konfirmasi jika tumpang tindihnya hanya karena kesalahan GPS."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This pH was measured on drained soil, and flooding often moves pH toward neutral, so it is worth checking first." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "pH ini diukur pada tanah yang dikeringkan, dan penggenangan sering menggeser pH ke arah netral, jadi sebaiknya diperiksa dulu."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This plot is no longer here" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Petak ini sudah tidak ada"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This plot looked low twice in a row." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Petak ini terlihat rendah dua kali berturut-turut."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This reading" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Hasil ini"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This report shows the advice the app showed on %@." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Laporan ini menampilkan saran yang ditunjukkan aplikasi pada %@."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This sample is hard to read. Check it again before changing anything." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Sampel ini sulit dibaca. Periksa lagi sebelum mengubah apa pun."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This sweep has no sample details, so there is no result to show." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Pemindaian ini tidak punya detail sampel, jadi tidak ada hasil untuk ditampilkan."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This sweep was not counted, so there is no advice yet." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Pemindaian ini tidak dihitung, jadi belum ada saran."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This sweep was not counted: the detector could not open." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Pemindaian ini tidak dihitung: detektor tidak bisa dibuka."
          }
        }
